49:24.230 --> 49:29.570
<b>Ruby Hoshino
Akane Kurokawa
Kana Arima
MEMcho
Aqua Hoshino
Taiki Himekawa
Frill Shiranui
\h
\h
\h
Norio Mita
Jan Tomato
Melt Narushima
Mei Adashino</b>

49:24.860 --> 49:28.010
Huh? There are still some 
empty spaces in the cast list.

49:28.010 --> 49:29.570
Oh, you're right.

49:29.860 --> 49:32.100
Yeah, those are the kid roles.

49:32.100 --> 49:34.780
We just haven't been able 
to pencil those in.

49:36.580 --> 49:40.620
It's so hard to find good child actors.

49:40.620 --> 49:45.680
I've been screening them 
all over the country, but no dice.

49:45.680 --> 49:49.970
They stick out like a sore thumb when 
you give them lines in a serious movie.

49:49.970 --> 49:53.410
Child actors who can handle long lines 
with ease are worth their weight in gold.

49:53.410 --> 49:54.970
I know what you mean.

49:54.970 --> 50:01.260
Quality films need child actors as good 
as me born in the same time frame!

50:01.260 --> 50:05.440
Must suck so hard for this era 
to have nobody on my level!

50:05.440 --> 50:08.190
Look at her cling to her past glories.

50:08.740 --> 50:11.280
I gotta go looking right after this, too.

50:11.280 --> 50:12.780
Good luck!

50:17.910 --> 50:20.710
You look like you've steeled yourself.

50:21.260 --> 50:25.880
To hurt people, and to be hurt in turn.

50:26.600 --> 50:28.400
Do you have nothing better to do?

50:28.400 --> 50:30.730
You keep showing up to grind my gears.

50:31.190 --> 50:34.970
I'm merely trying to guide you onto 
the right path toward your fate.

50:35.450 --> 50:38.680
Fate, eh? What are you, 
a god or something?

50:39.100 --> 50:44.020
Now, that depends on how 
you people define a "god."

50:44.690 --> 50:46.210
Different question.

50:46.210 --> 50:48.940
Do you have parents? A government ID?

50:49.340 --> 50:50.230
Of course.

50:50.930 --> 50:55.450
This vessel was born of a mother, 
much like you two.

50:55.910 --> 50:57.450
Do you want to check?

50:57.450 --> 50:59.660
It's just another child's body 
you'd find anywhere.

51:00.630 --> 51:01.940
Huh.

51:03.510 --> 51:04.520
What?

51:05.600 --> 51:06.710
Listen...

51:07.360 --> 51:08.800
Wanna be a child actor?

51:10.880 --> 51:11.750
Wha?

51:12.920 --> 51:16.220
<b>Episode 35










The Beginning</b>

